<title>SPAIN: Vallehermoso Q1 attributable up 12.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Vallehermoso Q1 attributable up 12.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish property group Vallehermoso said on Wednesday its net attributable profit in the first quarter was 1.56 billion pesetas, up 12.1 percent versus 1.39 billion in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>In a statement it added that group rental income rose 15.6 percent to 1.79 billion pesetas, with earnings on rental activity up 22.1 percent.</p>
<p>Group sales fell 13.2 percent to 9.12 billion pesetas, due to lower demand.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit rose 2.5 percent to 2.35 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
